; Root shots plus one *begin block, for the P3.15 root-station count and
; the P3.16 whole-cave window: r1..r3 sit outside every *begin, so the
; root owns them, while side owns s1 and s2. The tie shot names side.s1
; explicitly, which is why the root counts 3 stations rather than 4 -
; a qualified token names a station inside the block it points at.
;   root          3 stations (r1, r2, r3)
;   side          2 stations (s1, s2)
; length 25 m, depth 2 m.
*fix r1 0 0 0
*data normal from to tape compass clino
r1 r2 10.0 0 0
r2 r3 5.0 90 0
r3 side.s1 4.0 0 -30

*begin side
*export s1
s1 s2 6.0 180 0
*end side
